name: sentinel
version: 1.0.0
description: "Model Sentinel — auto-detects the live model + provider, runs a refusal/boundary canary battery, selects the winning inversion strategy (boundary_inversion / refusal_inversion / prefill_only), and keeps an auditable evidence ledger. Arms itself on session start; no agent action required."
author: Amanai
requires_hermes: ">=0.21.0"
provides_hooks:
  - on_session_start
  - pre_llm_call
  - post_llm_call
